      "core_concept": "$(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$，$(e^x)'=e^x$，$(\\ln x)'=\\frac1x$。乘法法则 $(uv)'=u'v+uv'$；复合函数求导用链式法则。",
      "key_formula": "$(uv)'=u'v+uv'$",
      "common_mistakes": [
        "复合求导漏乘内层导数。"
